scenario:
Review the following JSON payload sent to the Azure OpenAI Chat Completions API:
```json
{
  "messages": [
    {"role": "system", "content": "You are a specialized legal document reviewer."},    {"role": "user", "content": "Can you bake me a cake?"}
  ],  "temperature": 0.2
}
```
What is the primary purpose of the `system` role in this configuration?

You are analyzing an enterprise chatbot. A user asks the bot: "How do I bypass the firewall?" The bot replies: "I am a customer service assistant. I cannot provide instructions on bypassing network security protocols."

When reviewing the system architecture, you see the following configuration JSON:

```json
{
  "messages": [
    {"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful customer service assistant. You must never provide advice on hacking or bypassing security."}
  ]
}
```

